) years of budget cuts that have left essential services crippled, and* >> *(iii) failing to support Australian families who rely on penalty rates.*","result":"affirmative","slug":"division-federal-senate-5479","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2018-10-17/11"}
